 loomux · 12:03
   ## What was wrong

   The test raced the stream's first event. Two fixes:

   1.  waitFor  now waits for the  task_update , not for a timeout.
   2. The fake server sends its heartbeat after the first frame.

     npm test -- ConversationPage --repeat 50

   All 50 runs pass. See the stream's notes https://example.net/docs/stream.

